      "text": "Golden build failed\n\nDeleteActorTemplate by UID, then create it again\nafter 15s, 1m, 4m, then every 10m (up to 20% jitter)\nReady=False \u00b7 ActorTemplateRetrying\nschedule persisted on runtime_revision, survives restarts",
      "originalText": "Golden build failed\n\nDeleteActorTemplate by UID, then create it again\nafter 15s, 1m, 4m, then every 10m (up to 20% jitter)\nReady=False \u00b7 ActorTemplateRetrying\nschedule persisted on runtime_revision, survives restarts",
